WEBVTT

00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:01.058
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Grace</b>

00:00:02.629 --> 00:00:05.421
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Have you bought anything from a chain store recently?

00:00:05.908 --> 00:00:07.016
<v><b>Grace:</b></v> Yes, I have.

00:00:07.248 --> 00:00:09.202
I went to H&amp;M three weeks ago.

00:00:09.344 --> 00:00:10.643
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> And what did you buy?

00:00:10.972 --> 00:00:12.114
<v><b>Grace:</b></v> I bought a skirt.

00:00:12.414 --> 00:00:14.589
It’s a long, black skirt.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:15.841
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Are you happy with it?

00:00:16.124 --> 00:00:18.602
<v><b>Grace:</b></v> Yes, yes, and, er…

00:00:18.619 --> 00:00:21.563
it was very cheap because it was in the sale.

00:00:21.694 --> 00:00:22.764
And it suits me.

00:00:25.457 --> 00:00:26.359
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Emilia</b>

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.570
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Have you been shopping for clothes recently?

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:34.215
<v><b>Emilia:</b></v> Yes, I went shopping at the weekend with my friends.

00:00:34.381 --> 00:00:35.339
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where did you go?

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.523
<v><b>Emilia:</b></v> We went to the city centre, to Princes Street,

00:00:38.552 --> 00:00:40.286
that’s where we always go.

00:00:40.471 --> 00:00:41.624
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Did you buy anything?

00:00:41.726 --> 00:00:43.978
<v><b>Emilia:</b></v> I tried on a few things in Zara,

00:00:44.126 --> 00:00:47.137
but in the end there wasn’t anything I liked.

00:00:47.619 --> 00:00:51.690
The only thing I bought was a new case for my phone in the Apple store.

00:00:52.025 --> 00:00:53.494
I really like it.

00:00:55.914 --> 00:00:56.657
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Leo</b>

00:00:58.374 --> 00:01:00.675
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Have you ever bought anything from Uniqlo?

00:01:01.099 --> 00:01:04.626
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Sure, I often buy stuff on their website.

00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.899
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What was the last thing you bought from them?

00:01:06.955 --> 00:01:09.626
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> I got some T-shirts a few weeks ago.

00:01:09.904 --> 00:01:11.119
I always get them there.

00:01:11.391 --> 00:01:12.662
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How many did you get?

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:15.032
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Three…or was it four?

00:01:15.348 --> 00:01:16.555
No, it was three.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.291
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> And are you happy with them?

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:19.234
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Yes.

00:01:19.466 --> 00:01:20.721
I like their T-shirts

00:01:20.999 --> 00:01:22.426
and they were good value –

00:01:22.799 --> 00:01:25.112
about £15.00 each.